OL,3,GNEWSANo sole trigger for student's
OL,4,Adeath, coroner says
OL,5,
OL,6,FNeither the family of a "kind young
OL,7,Fman", nor the staff at the college
OL,8,Fwhere he died, had any idea the student
OL,9,Fhad thoughts of taking his own life, a
OL,10,Fcoroner has said.
OL,12,FSam Coutts, 18, was found dead at Queen
OL,13,FElizabeth Sixth Form College,
OL,14,FDarlington, in January, after a meeting
OL,15,Fwith the vice-principal about social
OL,16,Fmedia posts in which he had revealed he
OL,17,Fhad a crush on his support worker.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
