OL,3,GNEWSANo sole trigger for student's
OL,4,Adeath, coroner says
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn the third day of the inquest at
OL,7,FCrook Civic Centre, County Durham
OL,8,FCoroner Crispin Oliver gave a
OL,9,Fconclusion of suicide, but said there
OL,10,Fwas "no sole triggering" event behind
OL,11,Fit.
OL,13,F"This tragedy was the end point of a
OL,14,Fcontinuum of various factors and events
OL,15,Fbuilding up over months."
